<title>SPAIN: Asturiana 96 net attrib loss 2.65 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Asturiana 96 net attrib loss 2.65 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain zinc producer Asturiana de Zinc 1996 consolidated results.</p>
<p>(in billions of pesetas unlss specified)</p>
<p>						1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net attrib loss			  2.65  vs 11.08 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss			     2.75  vs 10.84 loss</p>
<p> Extraordinary losses		   5.01  vs nil</p>
<p> Operating losses			 nil   vs 8.54</p>
<p> Total costs			     48.69  vs 56.19</p>
<p> Personnel costs			  9.34  vs  9.26</p>
<p> Financial costs			  2.83  vs  2.60</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said in a statement that the results were better than 1995 despite a depressed zinc price throughout the year. It said an improvement in the structure of the company and contributed towards the rebound.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
